{"id":"2b92bd908c1baefd","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-separation-theorem.md","title":"Borel Separation of Disjoint Analytic Relations","display":"thm-separation-theorem — Borel Separation of Disjoint Analytic Relations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-separation-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-separation-theorem"],"display":"thm-separation-theorem — Borel Separation of Disjoint Analytic Relations","depends_on":["[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]","[[68-df-borel-relation]]","[[68-df-separation-of-relations]]","[[68-lem-borel-countable-separation]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"20.4 pp.77–78 / PDF 86–87","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-read; finite-arity-transfer-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-separation-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-separation-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-separation-theorem — Borel Separation of Disjoint Analytic Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"150b567749c83f49\" href=\"?note=150b567749c83f49\" title=\"68-df-projective-hierarchy\">68-df-projective-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61df304a04864967\" href=\"?note=61df304a04864967\" title=\"68-df-borel-relation\">68-df-borel-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1827d5ca5ea813ed\" href=\"?note=1827d5ca5ea813ed\" title=\"68-df-separation-of-relations\">68-df-separation-of-relations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fb520eeb2ca8e0fc\" href=\"?note=fb520eeb2ca8e0fc\" title=\"68-lem-borel-countable-separation\">68-lem-borel-countable-separation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"20.4 pp.77–78 / PDF 86–87"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-read; finite-arity-transfer-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_1^{1,(m,k)}\">\\(A,B\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_1^{1,(m,k)}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap B=\\varnothing\">\\(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{m,k}\">\\(X_{m,k}\\)</span>、投射类、Borel 类及分离谓词分别见所列直接依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_{X_{m,k}}(A,B,C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_{X_{m,k}}(A,B,C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 20.4 以 m=1,k=0 简化证明记号。若 A、B 不能由 Borel 集分离，先合并两侧的有限实参数元组为固定参数 δ，再用 19.1 后的正规形写成递归于 δ 的有限初段关系的实存在投影；整个分支构造中 δ 保持固定。把每一有限初段分支分解为其可数个一阶延长；计数分离引理保证可继续选择一对仍不可分离的非空分支。两支对共同实输入的下一数值必须一致，否则相应递归柱集已分离它们。递归构造给出共同输入实数及两支见证，所以属于 A∩B，矛盾。对有限个实输入可用递归交织编码，有限自然数输入用离散切片及可数并转移；m=0 也在此范围。此处核对了原书证明及其有限元数推广，不声称已完成证明助手验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"150b567749c83f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-borel-relation","status":"resolved","id":"61df304a04864967","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-borel-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-separation-of-relations","status":"resolved","id":"1827d5ca5ea813ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-separation-of-relations]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-lem-borel-countable-separation","status":"resolved","id":"fb520eeb2ca8e0fc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-lem-borel-countable-separation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_1^{1,(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\cap B=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_{X_{m,k}}(A,B,C).","display":true}],"bytes":1834,"backlinks":[{"id":"53a901d3f85d3dac","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"§10 的 SG_68 包含单位元；§20 的 SigmaRing 要求包含全集并对相对补集闭合，均沿用本书精确定义。原包关于 19.3 与 20.5 的勘误记录分别见 [[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]]、[[68-thm-separation-theorem]]；本次未重新核对未随附件提供的原书 PDF。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-separation-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"混合元数与层级：[[68-df-baire-space]] → [[68-df-real-machine]] → [[68-df-recursive-real-function]] → [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]] → [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]] → [[68-thm-separation-theorem]] → [[68-thm-suslin-theorem]]。有限二进制串另记为 $\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]，不与 Baire 空间 $\\mathcal B$ 混用。"}],"outgoing":["150b567749c83f49","61df304a04864967","1827d5ca5ea813ed","fb520eeb2ca8e0fc"]}